As of version 3.42, the job (and thus channel) table size can be configured for
some machines.
The value thus configured corresponds to the number of entries in the JOB table.
The number of entrie in the CHANNEL table is directly derived from this value:
it is three times as much.
The allowed range is from 80 to 10000.
The default value is 120 (i.e the size previously used).
This only applies to SMSQE for QPC, Qx0, SMSQmulator and Q68.
